//          stack: [db]/[column]/[json] field tags, std/orm table
//          mapping, json.MarshalStruct/UnmarshalInto, and the
//          std/web router. Handlers are framework-shaped
//          fn(Request, *ResponseWriter) so the same code is exercised
//          by a live server and by in-process tests via ServeHTTP.
